---
source: crates/explain/src/codes/tests.rs
expression: shown(code)
---
$ mix install ripgrep
error: systemd couldn't start `nix-daemon.socket`

help: see why with:
        journalctl -u nix-daemon.socket
      then run `mix install` again

$ mix explain unit-failed
UNIT_FAILED

A unit `mix` manages could not be started, stopped, enabled or reloaded.

The unit is usually `nix-daemon`, and the message names it. Its own log says why it failed.

To fix it:
  - see why with `journalctl -u <unit>`
  - run the command again
